":"般若菠萝菠萝菠萝蜜","avatar":{"url":"https://image.kungal.iloveren.link/20/f0/20f02764b8d94df44015967ff9020c635420ff6500613e7f051ece0a1a04ad1d.webp","hash":"20f02764b8d94df44015967ff9020c635420ff6500613e7f051ece0a1a04ad1d","width":null,"height":null,"thumbhash":null,"sexual":null},"avatar_frame":null},"path":"/topic/4491","excerpt_markdown":"上大学就轻松了这句话毫无疑问是骗人的，所以我们要自己优化一下大学生活（笑），不争奖学金这些的话，只要活着和不挂科就行，晚自习不去他顶多扣你综测分，至于第二课堂学分，到大四导员肯定会帮你们，暂时不用管。水课的期末大作业善用AI，还有要刷的网课我推荐OCS，自动刷课免费，自动答题和考试需要额度，但很便宜，20块钱一万道题这种。这些七七八八的打理下来应该能轻松些，主打有苦不吃有福就享，让自己开心才最重要，希望楼主能享受大学四年\n","topic":null,"topic_digest":null,"reply":{"reply_id":"17868","topic_id":"4491","topic_title":"大学怎么比高中还难受","floor":1,"content":{"object":"document","children":[{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"上大学就轻松了这句话毫无疑问是骗人的，所以我们要自己优化一下大学生活（笑），不争奖学金这些的话，只要活着和不挂科就行，晚自习不去他顶多扣你综测分，至于第二课堂学分，到大四导员肯定会帮你们，暂时不用管。水课的期末大作业善用AI，还有要刷的网课我推荐OCS，自动刷课免费，自动答题和考试需要额度，但很便宜，20块钱一万道题这种。这些七七八八的打理下来应该能轻松些，主打有苦不吃有福就享，让自己开心才最重要，希望楼主能享受大学四年"}]}]},"quoted":null},"comment":null,"work":null,"work_digest":null,"work_stats":null,"work_revision":null,"galgame_rating":null,"resource":null,"quiz":null,"toolset":null,"todo":null,"update_log":null},{"object":"activity","id":"23389378","activity_type":"galgame_edit","occurred_at":"2026-10-17T19:16:04Z","performer":{"object":"user","id":"138836","name":"Andm","avatar":null,"avatar_frame":null},"path":"/galgame/4002","excerpt_markdown":"","topic":null,"topic_digest":null,"reply":null,"comment":null,"work":{"object":"work","id":"4002","display_name":"冬日树下的回忆","latin":null,"localized":{"en":{"value":"Memories of the Winter Tree","is_machine":false},"zh-Hans":{"value":"冬日树下的回忆","is_machine":false},"zh-Hant":{"value":"冬日樹下的回憶","is_machine":false}},"cover":{"url":"https://image.kungal.iloveren.link/cf/f9/cff97f200251dba5f2f55e02f7dd9aa428739845419c37c2e3809d86f58d5965.webp","hash":"cff97f200251dba5f2f55e02f7dd9aa428739845419c37c2e3809d86f58d5965","width":256,"height":384,"thumbhash":"8wcKBQJvhT+YyHhIelx5mKaPk6kH","sexual":"safe"},"is_nsfw":false},"work_digest":{"developer_names":["Li Yu Keji","MagicaLuv"],"intro_excerpt":"我的梦想是成为一名教师或者医生，在学业结束后我收到了来自医院的第一份工作实习邮件。\n\n在这所医院里我将担任实习治疗师(sensei)的工作，而我扶着的是以为叫“言叶”的女孩。\n\n在照顾言叶一年之后终于马上迎来出院的日子，但是在某晚我却听到了有关“天使”的奇怪对话，为了帮助“言叶”我开始寻找事情背后的真相……","release":"2022-12-15"},"work_stats":null,"work_revision":{"revision_number":2,"legacy_revision_id":null},"galgame_rating":null,"resource":null,"quiz":null,"toolset":null,"todo":null,"update_log":null},{"object":"activity","id":"23389376","activity_type":"topic_reply_creation","occurred_at":"2026-10-17T18:12:35Z","performer":{"object":"user","id":"139173","name":"echan","avatar":null,"avatar_frame":null},"path":"/topic/4489","excerpt_markdown":"这么强，智齿\n","topic":null,"topic_digest":null,"reply":{"reply_id":"17867","topic_id":"4489","topic_title":"[开源]鲲 Galgame 论坛安卓app端","floor":2,"content":{"object":"document","children":[{"object":"paragraph","children":[{"object":"text","value":"这么强，智齿"}]}]},"quoted":null},"comment":null,"work":null,"work_digest":null,"work_stats":null,"work_revision":null,"galgame_rating":null,"resource":null,"quiz":null,"toolset":null,"todo":null,"update_log":null},{"object":"activity","id":"23389375","activity_type":"topic_creation","occurred_at":"2026-10-17T18:03:50Z","performer":{"object":"user","id":"39202","name":"RAINBOW","avatar":null,"avatar_frame":null},"path":"/topic/4491","excerpt_markdown":"大学怎么比高中还难受","topic":{"object":"topic","id":"4491","title":"大学怎么比高中还难受","state":"published","category":"others","sections":["o-daily"],"cover_images":[],"author":{"object":"user","id":"39202","name":"RAINBOW","avatar":null,"avatar_frame":null},"view_count":54,"like_count":0,"reply_count":2,"comment_count":0,"has_best_answer":false,"mini_apps":[],"is_nsfw":false,"bumped_at":"2026-10-18T01:57:28Z","created_at":"2026-10-17T18:03:50Z","edited_at":null,"upvoted_at":null},"topic_digest":{"excerpt_markdown":"刚上大学，我发现我高三过得才是最舒服的。。。\n\n那个时候，不用交作业，不上晚自习，白天来学校睡一睡吃个饭，五点放学去图书馆看点文学或者直接回家推gal\n\n但是这个该死的大学所有东西都要计平时分里，还有莫名其妙的学时要靠参加一堆意义不明的活动来拿\n\n虽然高中也有强制大课间跑操之类的反人类规定，但是我明显觉得大学里妨碍我的东西更多了，任务也更多了\n\n我猜这里还是比我岁数大的朋友更多吧，不知道大家是怎么过来的？\n","favorite_count":1,"edited_at":null,"top_reply":null,"best_answer_excerpt":null,"latest_upvote":null,"latest_reply":{"reply_id":"17872","floor":2,"author":{"object":"user","id":"125818","name":"YEEEEE","avatar":{"url":"https://image.kungal.iloveren.link/ec/40/ec40e4cfcada85fea61aef4bf73e73dd73cc7d9fbc0f30be51ad28a3bbe7cf0a.webp","hash":"ec40e4cfcada85fea61aef4bf73e73dd73cc7d9fbc0f30be51ad28a3bbe7cf0a","width":null,"height":null,"thumbhash":null,"sexual":null},"avatar_frame":null},"excerpt_markdown":"事实上，中国大部分的高中，尤其是三四线城市的高中，都要交作业，上晚自习，而且基本都是住宿制+军事化管理，在学校待一周或更多周都不能玩任何电子产品。别说打gal了，你连听歌都只能听宿舍放的爱国红色歌曲\n","like_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-18T01:57:28Z"},"latest_comment":null,"reactions":[{"reaction":"heart","count":1,"reactors":[{"object":"user","id":"42462","name":"xzyh","avatar":{"url":"https://image.kungal.iloveren.link/67/5a/675aecae8ffb0046340fdac092c60f4aabba78925ece5cde69fce063d61046bb.webp","hash":"675aecae8ffb0046340fdac092c60f4aabba78925ece5cde69fce063d61046bb","width":null,"height":null,"thumbhash":null,"sexual":null},"avatar_frame":null}],"viewer":null}]},"reply":null,"comment":null,"work":null,"work_digest":null,"work_stats":null,"work_revision":null,"galgame_rating":null,"resource":null,"quiz":null,"toolset":null,"todo":null,"update_log":null}],"next_cursor":"cur_eyJ2IjoxLCJzIjoib2NjdXJyZWRfZGVzYyIsImYiOiI2YzZiZWQzMjZmMTFkMWJlYTdjYWNjZjFjZWE5MjMzMTU4NTNjOTVmZjk4ODZhNjRlMjlkZjBkMjE4NGMxOWFmIiwiayI6WyIyMDI2LTEwLTE3VDE4OjAzOjUwLjI4NVoiLCJUT1BJQ19DUkVBVElPTiIsIjQ0OTEiXX0"}
